  <p><img src="graphicsbar.gif" width="350" height="32"></p>
  <p><u><b><font size="6" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">Our Charter</font></b></u></p>
  <p><font color="#333333" size="5" face="Arial Black">Our guild is designed to not only help 
    members improve and advance their characters but also to Create a family of true friends who wish to bring their Dreams into Reality, of people who 
    value and strive for honesty, integrity, dignity, respect, compassion and 
    generosity.&nbsp;</font></p>
  <p class="MsoBodyText"><font face="Arial Black" size="5">Dreamweavers is about
  family, not loot, not big mobs, not who has the bigger better stuff. It's
  about helping when you can, and sending a kind word when you can’t. Its
  about family orientated chat, that anyone's parent, or child could read, and
  you don’t have to worry about what it says.</font></p>
  <p><font face="Arial Black" size="5"><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Times New Roman; mso-bidi-font-family: Times New Roman; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">We
  are interested in recruiting players who have a sense of fun, respect other
  people, care for their friends and are willing to help out when needed.&nbsp;&nbsp;
  If your intent is to join a guild that will help you
  get your epic on your way to an uber guild: this is not where you should be. If
  your only interest is in raiding/camping to acquire loot or level quicker: you will find there are better guilds
  for you on this server.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p>
  <p><font face="Arial Black" size="5"><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Times New Roman; mso-bidi-font-family: Times New Roman; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">If your idea of fun is to
  group with nice people, participate in different raids and help others, you
  may belong with us.</span></font></p>
  <p><img src="graphicsbar.gif" width="350" height="32"></p>
  <p><u><b><font size="6" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">Our Motto:</font></b> </u></p>
  <p><b><font size="5" color="#333333" face="Arial Black"> &quot;All 
    that you see or seem, is but a dream within a dream.</font></b></p>
  <p><b><font size="5" color="#333333" face="Arial Black"> Turn your dreams into 
    reality."</font></b></p>
  <p><img src="graphicsbar.gif" width="350" height="32"></p>
  <p><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Times New Roman; mso-bidi-font-family: Times New Roman; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><b><u><font face="Arial Black" size="6">OUR
  GOALS:</font></u></b></span></p>
  <p><font face="Arial Black" size="5"><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Times New Roman; mso-bidi-font-family: Times New Roman; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">Right
  now our goals are simple.&nbsp;</span></font></p>
  <p><font face="Arial Black" size="5"><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Times New Roman; mso-bidi-font-family: Times New Roman; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">We
  want to give our members the opportunity to make the most they can out of
  their character.&nbsp;</span></font></p>
  <p><img src="graphicsbar.gif" width="350" height="32"></p>
  <p><b><u><font size="6" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">Guild Requirements:</font></u></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">If you
  are:</font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">1.) Looking to Join a
  Family Oriented Guild on the Tunare Server where raids voluntary,&nbsp;</font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font face="Arial Black"><font size="4" color="#333333">2.) Your MAIN CHARACTER 
    is in the </font><font color="#333333" size="6">50th</font><font size="4" color="#333333">
  level of adventuring,</font></font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">3.)
  Willing to help others and PARTICIPATE in events and raids,&nbsp;</font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">4.) Not looking to
  guild hop, be power-leveled, or be given Epics/high level gear without helping
  others,</font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black"> 5.) Comfortable with optional
  role-playing,</font></b></p>
  <p align="left"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">6.)
  Willing to exemplify our Virtues while acting in a mature, selfless manner,</font></b></p>
  <p align="center"><b><font size="4" color="#333333" face="Arial Black">We
  would like you to <a href="applications.asp"> apply to join our guild</a>. &nbsp;</font><font face="Sylfaen" color="#333333" size="4">&nbsp;</font></b></p>
  <p align="center"><img src="graphicsbar.gif" width="350" height="32"><b><font face="Sylfaen" color="#333333" size="4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></b></p>
